Toowoomba Regional Council (Council) is seeking suppliers for the provision of wet and/or dry hire of site temporary fencing, on an as required basis for the entire region. This tender will be awarded to a panel of suppliers who can demonstrate that they:

•	Can provide a range of products suitable to Council’s requirements in a timely and efficient manner;

•	Can provide a hire service seven (7) days a week suitable to Council’s requirements; and

•	Are prepared to provide such products to Council on the terms and conditions set out in the offer document and relating documents.

Types of equipment to be covered under this quote are site security and site safety products that may include but are not limited to:

•	Temporary Mesh Fencing;

•	Temporary Hoarding Fence;

•	Crowd Barrier Fencing;

•	Temporary Pool Fencing; 

•	Temporary Event Fencing.
